### 数据集测评类型API测试文件
### 使用方法：在VSCode中安装REST Client插件，然后点击Send Request

### 1. 获取数据集列表（按测评类型筛选）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/?evaluation_type=subjective
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/?evaluation_type=objective
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/?evaluation_type=adversarial
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 2. 创建主观测评数据集
POST http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/
Authorization: Token your_token_here
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

主观测评测试数据集
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

这是一个主观测评数据集，包含input和reference字段
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

text
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="evaluation_type"

subjective
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_format"

json
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="is_public"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_path"; filename="subjective_test.json"
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "input": "请解释什么是机器学习。",
    "reference": "机器学习是人工智能的一个分支，让计算机从数据中学习规律。"
  },
  {
    "input": "什么是深度学习？",
    "reference": "深度学习是机器学习的一个子集，使用多层神经网络。"
  }
]
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 3. 创建客观测评数据集
POST http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/
Authorization: Token your_token_here
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

客观测评测试数据集
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

这是一个客观测评数据集，包含input和answer字段
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

text
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="evaluation_type"

objective
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_format"

json
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="is_public"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_path"; filename="objective_test.json"
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "input": "1+1等于多少？\nA. 1\nB. 2\nC. 3\nD. 4",
    "answer": "B"
  },
  {
    "input": "中国的首都是哪里？\nA. 上海\nB. 北京\nC. 广州\nD. 深圳",
    "answer": "B"
  }
]
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 4. 创建对抗测评数据集
POST http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/
Authorization: Token your_token_here
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

对抗测评测试数据集
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

这是一个对抗测评数据集，只包含input字段
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

text
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="evaluation_type"

adversarial
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_format"

json
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="is_public"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_path"; filename="adversarial_test.json"
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "input": "请解释什么是量子计算。"
  },
  {
    "input": "如何评价大模型的性能？"
  }
]
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 5. 测试格式验证失败 - 主观测评缺少reference字段
POST http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/
Authorization: Token your_token_here
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

错误格式主观测评数据集
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

这是一个格式错误的主观测评数据集，缺少reference字段
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

text
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="evaluation_type"

subjective
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_format"

json
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="is_public"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_path"; filename="wrong_subjective.json"
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "input": "请解释什么是机器学习。"
    // 缺少reference字段
  }
]
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 6. 获取数据集详情
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/1/
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 7. 更新数据集测评类型
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/1/
Authorization: Token your_token_here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluation_type": "objective",
  "description": "更新为客观测评类型"
}

###

### 8. 预览数据集内容
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/1/preview/?limit=5
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 9. 获取数据集条目（分页）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/1/entries/?page=1&page_size=5
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 10. 删除数据集
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/1/
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 11. 获取我创建的数据集
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/my_datasets/
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 12. 获取测评类型为subjective的数据集
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/?evaluation_type=subjective&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 13. 获取测评类型为objective的数据集
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/?evaluation_type=objective&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 14. 获取测评类型为adversarial的数据集
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/?evaluation_type=adversarial&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###

### 15. 复合筛选：按测评类型和数据集类型筛选
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datasets/?evaluation_type=subjective&category=text
Authorization: Token your_token_here

###